  "description": "Paper Bird is an origami crane turned into a climbing structure, part of our Kagzi collection. The folded body is finished in Baby Blue, with a rope net to climb and yellow stepping pods underneath, and children can also hang from the frame and slide off it. It is made for ages 5 to 12, holds up to 15 children, and needs a safe play area of 17'5\" x 14' around a product area of 12'5\" x 9'. From a garden path it reads like a sculpture, which many society committees like. Play on it builds body strength, balance and cooperative play. The galvanised pipes, roto-moulded parts, composite laminates and play rope carry a 3-year warranty. Ask us where it would sit on your layout.",
